      <div id="L_202601730EN.000401.fmx">
         <div class="eli-container" id="anx_I">
            <p class="oj-doc-ti" id="d1e35-4-1">ANNEX I</p>
            <p class="oj-normal">In Annex I of Implementing Regulation (EU) 2025/848, the following point is added:</p>
            <table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
               <col width="4%"/>
               <col width="96%"/>
               <tbody>
                  <tr>
                     <td valign="top"  >
                        <p class="oj-normal">‘16.</p>
                     </td>
                     <td valign="top"  >
                        <p class="oj-normal">Where applicable, an association to the wallet-relying party that is relying upon the intermediary to whom the wallet-relying party access certificate has been issued and that is acting on behalf of the relying party who intends to rely upon the wallet.’</p>
                     </td>
                  </tr>
               </tbody>
            </table>
         </div>
      </div>
      <hr class="oj-doc-sep"/>
      <div id="L_202601730EN.000501.fmx">
