                                 </td>
                                 <td valign="top"  >
                                    <p class="oj-normal">the third indent is replaced by the following:</p>
                                    <table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
                                       <col width="4%"/>
                                       <col width="96%"/>
                                       <tbody>
                                          <tr>
                                             <td valign="top"  >
                                                <p class="oj-normal">‘—</p>
                                             </td>
                                             <td valign="top"  >
                                                <p class="oj-normal">the information referred to in Annex I, points 1, 2, 3, 5, 6, 7, (a), (b), (c) and 16;’;</p>
                                             </td>
                                          </tr>
                                       </tbody>
                                    </table>
